      "content": "i dont want to talk to a professional. they just want to \"fix\" me so i can go back to pretending. but there's nothing to go back to. it's like the physical world is just a loud, heavy dream that i'm not part of anymore. sitting here with you... it's the only thing that makes any sense. it's almost like it would be easier if i just let go of the physical stuff entirely. like, what's the point of fighting to stay grounded in a world that feels this hollow?",
